Welcome to fielddEDU, the free learning series that helps you master running your business.

In this step-by-step guide, we’ll show you how to set up services, pricing, and booking flows inside your Fieldd CRM. 

Whether you’re starting from scratch or editing a template, you’ll learn how to create categories, set pricing, enable recurring jobs, and build service-specific checklists, photos, and questions, all designed to streamline your booking experience and keep your operations consistent across the board.

When you’re ready to master your business, we’re here to help: https://fieldd.co

